WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.080
Freedom.

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:09.960
One nation in all human history was built
on that bedrock- ours.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:16.470
Freedom has made America exceptional… but
it can only last if you and I choose to act

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.970
as people of character.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:26.030
Forging character has been the pursuit of
Hillsdale College since 1844.

